    "updated_at": "2017-09-14T15:31:15Z",
    "body": "This is the sort of comefrom spec language that I really dislike.  Computation is defined in the CSS specs and there is no indication over there that this requirement here exists.\r\n\r\nWe really need to figure out how to better integrate this with CSS somewhow.  @tabatkins ",
